flowchart TD
    Dev[Developer Laptop] -->|terraform apply| TF[Terraform]
    TF --> EC2[EC2 Minecraft Host]
    TF --> SG[Security Group: SSH + TCP 25565]
    TF --> IP[Public IP]

    Dev -->|ansible-playbook| Ansible[Ansible]
    Ansible -->|install Docker + AWS CLI| EC2
    Ansible -->|docker login using LabInstanceProfile| ECR[ECR]
    Ansible -->|restore world backup| S3[S3 Backup Bucket]
    Ansible -->|run container /data mount| MC[Minecraft Container]

    GitHub[GitHub Tag Push] --> Actions[GitHub Actions]
    Actions -->|pull/tag/smoke test| Image[Minecraft Image]
    Actions -->|push pinned image| ECR

    Player[Minecraft Client] -->|TCP 25565| EC2